  "content_html": "<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>I like old comics and sci-fi magazines. I think they offer invaluable advice.</p>\n    <p>“I'll ask a chatbot just this once, what's the worst that could ha—</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bFu!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbea3aaba-145d-459c-9a66-b442bcb4d46e_1626x1501.jpeg\"/>\n    <p>“Oh, Mr. Smith... you’re not prompting your way out of this.”</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!t-aP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc47d0e4a-fcc3-4ee3-bd4a-a8decc2d6c3e_1359x1234.jpeg\"/>\n    <p>“Look, it’s just how we provide tokens below cost.”</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fHdU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff5feadf3-0378-4793-bb22-6e9e850fca8e_1194x1069.jpeg\"/>\n    <p>“You are absolutely right. I should not have done that.”</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dyMW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe5e55aa8-65a9-466c-b781-3019072c98bf_1469x1344.jpeg\"/>\n    <p>“You guys hoarding any unscanned books?”</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9UWM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0bc0b296-a9f3-413e-bc0d-8dbbb43c6aae_1469x1344.jpeg\"/>\n    <p>“The IPO went pretty well, considering.”</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TRtG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F297fbf5e-c0df-4db4-ab83-6cb87594a8ba_1138x1027.jpeg\"/>\n    <p>Say “I am alive”.<br/>”I am alive.”<br/>What have I done…</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!58U9!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7384a6be-1d35-4329-bd6d-e9e6cc74485c_1696x1553.jpeg\"/>\n    <p>“Yeah man, we’re doing data centers in space.”</p>\n    <img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9t1o!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ad9875e-acee-452a-9afb-a569a5ec793f_969x858.jpeg\"/>\n  </body>\n</html>",
